{
  "esm": "2.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_ppm_edge_e",
    "description": "The raw (un-limited) RIGHT (east/north) edge of one cell's MOM6 PPM parabola from the cell's 4-cell stencil (PPM_reconstruction_x, MOM_continuity_PPM.F90:2431, 2433): h_E = mom6_ppm_edge with h_side = h_p1, m_side = m_p1, slp_side = the cell's own slope mom6_ppm_slope(h_m1, h_0, h_p1) and slp_0 = the right neighbour's slope mom6_ppm_slope(h_0, h_p1, h_p2), i.e. h_E = 0.5*(h_ip1 + h_0) + (slp(i) - slp(i+1))/6 with the masked-neighbour replacement h_ip1. The mirror of mom6_ppm_edge_w (the slope roles swap, which is why the two edges are two laws over the one mom6_ppm_edge); positional stencil params as there. Pure scalar algebra, [m].",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:stencil", "family:mom6_cgrid", "grid:mom6_cgrid", "op:reconstruct"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Colella, P., & Woodward, P. R. (1984). The Piecewise Parabolic Method (PPM) for gas-dynamical simulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 54(1), 174-201.",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(84)90143-8"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [{ "ref": "./mom6_ppm_slope.esm" }, { "ref": "./mom6_ppm_edge.esm" }],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_ppm_edge_e": {
      "params": ["h_m1", "h_0", "h_p1", "h_p2", "m_m1", "m_0", "m_p1", "m_p2"],
      "description": "The raw right PPM edge of one cell (MOM_continuity_PPM.F90:2431, 2433)",
      "body": {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "mom6_ppm_edge",
        "bindings": {
          "h_side": "h_p1",
          "h_0": "h_0",
          "slp_side": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
            "bindings": { "h_m1": "h_m1", "h_0": "h_0", "h_p1": "h_p1", "m_m1": "m_m1", "m_0": "m_0", "m_p1": "m_p1" }
          },
          "slp_0": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "mom6_ppm_slope",
            "bindings": { "h_m1": "h_0", "h_0": "h_p1", "h_p1": "h_p2", "m_m1": "m_0", "m_0": "m_p1", "m_p1": "m_p2" }
          },
          "m_side": "m_p1"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
